  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 38428721152
    m_Localized: Focused Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915456
    m_Localized: Signals a target area, unleashing a volley of arrows and concentrating
      fire for 5 sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915457
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: 25 Piercing Damage every 1 sec.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915458
    m_Localized: Blazing Oil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915459
    m_Localized: Signals troops to hurl jars of blazing oil before the gate, engulfing
      the area in flames for 5 sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915460
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: 25 Fire Damage every 1 sec. Inflicts Ignited.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915461
    m_Localized: Eliminate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915462
    m_Localized: Marks the target enemy for elimination, making them the highest-priority
      target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38432915463
    m_Localized: 'Target enemy: Applies Elimination Mark. Becomes the top attack
      priority for nearby units.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900436193280
    m_Localized: Rock Barrage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776192
    m_Localized: Signals troops to launch a barrage of massive rocks at the target
      area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776193
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: 75 Blunt Damage. Inflicts Stun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776194
    m_Localized: Thundercloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776195
    m_Localized: Channels mystical energy to summon a Thundercloud that rains lightning
      over a wide area for 5 sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776196
    m_Localized: Every 0.5 sec, strikes 1 random enemy in area for 25 Lightning Damage
      and inflicts Electrocuted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776197
    m_Localized: Poison Barrage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776198
    m_Localized: Signals troops to hurl a jar of poison, creating a toxic zone for
      5 sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776199
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: 25 Poison Damage every 1 sec. Inflicts Poisoned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776200
    m_Localized: Gale Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776201
    m_Localized: The commander swings their fan, sending forth a blade of cutting
      wind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776202
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: 75 Slashing Damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776203
    m_Localized: Totem of Terror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776204
    m_Localized: Erects a Jangseung for 5 sec, striking fear into nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15005900448776205
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: Inflicts Intimidated every 1 sec.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21230694269763584
    m_Localized: Divine Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21230694290735104
    m_Localized: Awakens the target's spirit of devotion, granting an unbending will
      against enemy attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21230694290735105
    m_Localized: 'Target ally: Grants Unbending.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267794907136
    m_Localized: Chiyou's Roar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490048
    m_Localized: Roars with the might of Chiyou, overwhelming enemies with the omen
      of defeat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490049
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: Inflicts Intimidated.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490050
    m_Localized: Legendary Command
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490051
    m_Localized: Plants the commander's banner for 10 sec, raising the fighting spirit
      and vitality of nearby troops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490052
    m_Localized: 'All allies in area: Grants Battle Zeal and restores 5 HP every
      1 sec.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490053
    m_Localized: Scatter Caltrops
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490054
    m_Localized: Scatters caltrops across the path for 5 sec, greatly slowing enemies
      that pass through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490055
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: Movement Speed -50%. Deals 15 Fixed Damage
      every 1 sec.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490056
    m_Localized: Steel Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490057
    m_Localized: Sets a powerful steel trap at the target location, strong enough
      to catch even a wild boar. Up to 3 can be placed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490058
    m_Localized: 'When triggered: Deals 35 Fixed Damage to 1 enemy and inflicts Bound.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490059
    m_Localized: Blossom Trance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490060
    m_Localized: Scatters peach blossoms over an area, cleansing the troubled minds
      of allied troops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490061
    m_Localized: 'All allies in area: Removes negative status effects and grants
      Focus.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490062
    m_Localized: Thunderbolt Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490063
    m_Localized: Fires a powerful explosive shell from a Flying Thunderbolt Bomb
      at the target area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490064
    m_Localized: 'All enemies in area: 90 Fixed Damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490065
    m_Localized: Scorching Arrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490066
    m_Localized: The commander fires a flaming arrow at the target, engulfing them
      in flames that spread to nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490067
    m_Localized: 'Target enemy: 75 Piercing Damage. Inflicts Scorch.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490068
    m_Localized: Charge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490069
    m_Localized: A swift and stirring military march raises morale, driving allied
      troops into a coordinated charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86444267807490070
    m_Localized: 'All allies on the battlefield: Grants Battle Zeal and Swift Feet.'
